{
  "_readme": "One place for smoothing settings. Per tracker: bandwidthDays / minPollsInWindow / marginOfError (tracker-wide), plus 'subgroups' overrides keyed by subgroup value (lowercase, e.g. 'overall', '65+'); a subgroup not listed inherits the tracker-wide value. 'defaults' apply to every tracker unless it sets the same key: localLinear (sloped local fit; removes lag at the latest edge) and maxGapDays (no curve is drawn where the polls either side of a date are further apart than this). Per tracker you can also set 'enabled': false to stop it being rebuilt and listed (its last output stays on the site until removed), and 'name' to label it in trackers/index.csv.",
